      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": "[hidden] { display: none !important; }\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  background: #1e1e2f;\n  color: #e0e0e0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 1rem;\n}\n\n.game-container {\n  max-width: 600px;\n  width: 100%;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\nheader {\n  margin-bottom: 2rem;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 2rem;\n  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n  color: #f5a623;\n}\n\n.moves {\n  font-size: 1.2rem;\n  color: #a0a0b0;\n}\n\n.board {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n  gap: 0.75rem;\n  margin-bottom: 2rem;\n}\n\n.card {\n  aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-size: 0;\n  transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;\n  position: relative;\n  background: #2a2a40;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n}\n\n.card:not(.matched):not(.flipped):hover {\n  transform: scale(1.05);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #f5a623;\n}\n\n.card:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid #f5a623;\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n.card:active:not(.matched):not(.flipped) {\n  transform: scale(0.95);\n}\n\n.card.flipped,\n.card.matched {\n  background: var(--card-color);\n  box-shadow: none;\n}\n\n.card.matched {\n  opacity: 0.7;\n  cursor: default;\n}\n\n.card:not(.flipped):not(.matched)::after {\n  content: '?';\n  font-size: 1.8rem;\n  color: #606080;\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.win-message {\n  background: #2a2a40;\n  padding: 1rem;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  color: #f5a623;\n}\n\n.new-game-btn {\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  padding: 0.75rem 2rem;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  background: #f5a623;\n  color: #1e1e2f;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.1s;\n}\n\n.new-game-btn:hover {\n  background: #ffc04d;\n}\n\n.new-game-btn:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid #fff;\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n.new-game-btn:active {\n  transform: scale(0.97);\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 480px) {\n  body {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    padding: 0.5rem;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\n  }\n  .board {\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n  }\n  .card:not(.flipped):not(.matched)::after {\n    font-size: 1.4rem;\n  }\n}",
      "description": "Stylesheet with responsive layout and accessibility states"
    },
    {
      "path": "game.js",
      "content": "const COLORS = [\n  '#e74c3c', '#3498db', '#2ecc71', '#f1c40f',\n  '#9b59b6', '#e67e22', '#1abc9c', '#e84393'\n];\n\nconst board = document.getElementById('game-board');\nconst moveCountEl = document.getElementById('move-count');\nconst winMessage = document.getElementById('win-message');\nconst newGameBtn = document.getElementById('new-game');\n\nlet deck = [];\nlet flipped = [];\nlet matchedCount = 0;\nlet moves = 0;\nlet lock = false;\n\nfunction shuffle(arr) {\n  for (let i = arr.length - 1; i > 0; i--) {\n    const j = Math.floor(Math.random() * (i + 1));\n    [arr[i], arr[j]] = [arr[j], arr[i]];\n  }\n  return arr;\n}\n\nfunction createDeck() {\n  const cards = [];\n  COLORS.forEach((color, idx) => {\n    cards.push({ color, pairId: idx });\n    cards.push({ color, pairId: idx });\n  });\n  return shuffle(cards);\n}\n\nfunction renderBoard() {\n  board.innerHTML = '';\n  deck.forEach((card, index) => {\n    const btn = document.createElement('button');\n    btn.className = 'card';\n    btn.dataset.index = index;\n    btn.dataset.pairId = card.pairId;\n    btn.style.setProperty('--card-color', card.color);\n    btn.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Hidden card');\n    btn.addEventListener('click', () => handleCardClick(btn));\n    board.appendChild(btn);\n  });\n}\n\nfunction handleCardClick(btn) {\n  if (lock || btn.classList.contains('flipped') || btn.classList.contains('matched')) return;\n\n  btn.classList.add('flipped');\n  btn.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Revealed card');\n  flipped.push(btn);\n\n  if (flipped.length === 2) {\n    lock = true;\n    moves++;\n    moveCountEl.textContent = moves;\n\n    const [a, b] = flipped;\n    if (a.dataset.pairId === b.dataset.pairId) {\n      a.classList.add('matched');\n      b.classList.add('matched');\n      a.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Matched card');\n      b.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Matched card');\n      matchedCount++;\n      flipped = [];\n      lock = false;\n      if (matchedCount === COLORS.length) {\n        winMessage.hidden = false;\n      }\n    } else {\n      setTimeout(() => {\n        a.classList.remove('flipped');\n        b.classList.remove('flipped');\n        a.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Hidden card');\n        b.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Hidden card');\n        flipped = [];\n        lock = false;\n      }, 800);\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nfunction resetGame() {\n  deck = createDeck();\n  flipped = [];\n  matchedCount = 0;\n  moves = 0;\n  lock = false;\n  moveCountEl.textContent = '0';\n  winMessage.hidden = true;\n  renderBoard();\n}\n\nnewGameBtn.addEventListener('click', resetGame);\n\nresetGame();",
      "description": "Game logic with shuffle, flip, match, win detection, and reset"
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Memory Match\n\nA simple offline memory-match game with 8 pairs of colored cards.\n\n## How to run\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. No server or build step required.\n\n## Features\n\n- 8 pairs of colored cards (16 total)\n- Flip two cards at a time; matched pairs stay open\n- Move counter\n- Win message and New Game button\n- Keyboard accessible with labeled controls\n- Responsive layout down to 360px\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — structure\n- `styles.css` — styling\n- `game.js` — game logic\n",
      "description": "Project documentation with run instructions"
    }
  ]
}